From d2b60e8441b0f2f33ba8fbaa489d86c49c6ba56c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:05:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rawdanger-recomp: v0.8.3 FXAA, stronger occlusion, rain turns
 with the camera, mouse speed 1.0

- smaa.wgsl: FXAA 3.11 (quality 8) on the picture at its own size; keys.ini smaa = fxaa; F1 anti-aliasing list
- ambient occlusion: light 160/256, strong 230/256 (was barely visible)
- lens rain: the camera's turn read from its view direction (every camera mode), short wet marks instead of long trails,
  clinging drops creep with the air
- look_speed (mouse look) 1.0 by default

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
